msgstr ".input {$count :number} .input {$gender :string} .match $count $gender 0 female {{Sie hat keine Follower}} 0 male {{Er hat keine Follower}} 0 * {{Jemand hat keine Follower}} * female {{Sie hat {$count} Follower}} * male {{Er hat {$count} Follower}} * * {{Jemand hat {$count} Follower}}"

